
First, download the pretrained parameters for each network from the following links (Baidu Cloud):

	Parameters for compressed sensing reconstruction comparison at sampling rates of 0.1, 0.25, and 0.5.
	Encryption_parameters for compressed encryption.

After downloading the parameters, simply run the \texttt{cheshi\_1d.py} script. Note that you need to modify the variable:
images_path = 'G:/date/cs_data/Set11'
to the path of your own test image folder.
